    <summary>Free VPN client powered by sing-box and Xray</summary>
    <description>Kumo connects to the servers and subscriptions you choose. It can run as a local proxy (also set as the system proxy) or tunnel the whole computer, and it supports many protocols, subscriptions, routing rules, ad blocking and more.</description>
